### Variables
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:5000
@productServiceUrl = http://localhost:5101
@orderServiceUrl = http://localhost:5102

### 1. Gateway Status & Information
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Gateway Health Check (Liveness Probe)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health/live

### 3. Gateway Health Check (Readiness Probe)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health/ready

### =============================================================
### Product Microservice via Gateway (:5000) or Direct (:5101)
### =============================================================

### 4. Get all products (via API Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 5. Search products by keyword (e.g., 'Keyboard')
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products?search=Keyboard
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get product by ID (UltraBook Pro 15)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### 7. Create a new product in catalog
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noise Cancelling Headphones Pro",
  "description": "Premium over-ear wireless headphones with active noise cancellation",
  "price": 299.99,
  "stockQuantity": 45
}

### 8. Update product stock directly (+10 to stock)
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityChange": 10
}

### =============================================================
### Order Microservice via Gateway (:5000) or Direct (:5102)
### =============================================================

### 9. Get all orders (via API Gateway)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### 10. Place a new order
# (Decrements stock from ProductApi and confirms order)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "sarah.connor@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 11. Test Insufficient Stock Error
# (Attempting to order 999 units should fail gracefully with 400 Bad Request)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "heavy.buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
      "quantity": 9999
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Direct Order Service Readiness Probe
# (Shows dependency check status for Product Service)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/health/ready
